          "title": "Invisible to both searches, until renamed",
          "md": "**By name:** `scan0042.pdf` said nothing about Acme. The new name does.\n\n**By contents:** a scan is a picture of words, so grep still has no letters to match."
        },
        "librarian": {
          "body": "Titles first (file names), then what's inside (the words in each file). **Where it stops:** a library's catalogue is written in advance. Claude has none; it searches the shelves fresh each time."
